WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.748
A mystery does not need to reveal its answer in the opening image.

00:00:04.748 --> 00:00:09.352
Begin with an ordinary room and one detail that does not belong.

00:00:09.352 --> 00:00:12.014
Repeat that detail in a second place.

00:00:12.014 --> 00:00:16.690
Let the audience compare the two before introducing a third clue.

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:22.734
In Archive Nine, circles suggest clocks while parallel lines suggest stored records.

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:28.130
The visual pattern connects the scenes without explaining the missing hour.

